{"code":"008355","name":"남선알미우","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"비철금속","sector_desc":"구리·아연·알루미늄 등 제련·가공. 국제 금속 가격과 환율에 실적이 연동됩니다.","desc":"동사는 1947년 설립된 알루미늄 산업 종합 Maker로, SM그룹 계열사이며 2025년 삼라마이다스를 흡수합병하여 건설사업부문을 신규 편입함. 알루미늄 사업은 창호 브랜드 WINDART와 X-WIDE로 시장을 선도하고, 자동차 부문은 한국지엠에 부품을 공급하며, 건설 부문은 종합건설업을 영위하고 있음. 창호 기술연구소를 통한 방폭창 개발, 자동차의 자율주행 대응 기술, 건설의 플랜트 EPC 역량 강화에 집중하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-27","n_days":299,"close":6940.0,"open":6760.0,"high":7000.0,"low":6740.0,"volume":161,"amount":1117340.0,"ret_1d":1.909,"gap":-0.7342,"range_pct":3.7464,"ret_5":2.8148,"ret_20":-3.3426,"ret_60":-2.9371,"ret_120":-51.6376,"ret_250":-44.5244,"ma20":7045.5,"ma60":7164.8333,"ma120":8592.4167,"ma200":10889.3,"close_vs_ma200":-36.2677,"close_vs_ma60":-3.138,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-8.6864,"r2_60":0.0252,"slope_120":-75.9735,"r2_120":0.6378,"slope_250":-57.3917,"r2_250":0.6349,"high52":23400.0,"low52":6510.0,"pos_52w":2.5459,"dd_52w":-70.3419,"mdd_1y":-69.1469,"atr14_pct":4.7448,"vol_ann_60":41.6065,"vol_avg20":538.8,"vol_ratio20":0.2988,"vr5":1.1286,"vr20":0.106,"amount_avg5":4733986.0,"amount_avg20":3768582.0,"amount_avg60":3858369.0,"obv_chg20":5.1596,"turnover_20":3.5,"pv_eff_20":-0.955,"rsi14":46.8355,"frgn_net_5":14.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0045,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0045,"frgn_net_20":5.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0016,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0016,"frgn_net_60":-3.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.001,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.001,"frgn_net_120":166.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0539,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0539,"foreign_ratio":1.65,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":4,"op_income_q":-9.0,"op_margin_q":-1.087,"op_qoq":47.0588,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-175.0,"rev_yoy":12.3474,"op_trend_4q":48.4211,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-3.82,"debt_ratio":54.69,"per":null,"pbr":3.13,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":1.65,"target_price":